StateGraph(State)
→ Creates a graph that shares the given State.

add_node(node_name, function)
→ Registers a node (a function) with a name.

add_edge(from_node, to_node)
→ Always go from one node to the next.

add_conditional_edges(from_node, router_function, path_map)
→ After 'from_node', call router_function(state).
→ Whatever the router returns is looked up in path_map.
→ Execute the corresponding next node.